  "description": "Enterprise-grade PII & Privacy Analyzer for AI/LLM workflows. Detects, scores, and auto-masks sensitive data across 32 countries (27 EU + UK, Switzerland, China, Russia, Ukraine) with GDPR/AI Act/NIS2/PCI-DSS/NIST compliance flags, multi-session and multi-chatbot support, AI transparency notices, multi-language support, and YAML-driven extensible rules.",
