  "published": "2026-07-19T16:41:57.34Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.2: NuGet icon restored (caveman-icon.png now packed and referenced via PackageIcon). Added 5 new countries/validators: UK NINO, Swiss AHV/AVS, Chinese Resident ID, Russian INN, Ukrainian RNOKPP - each with a real checksum algorithm, not just regex. Fixed a cross-country false-positive: the German ID Card rule matched any 9-char alphanumeric string (including Spanish NIF and UK NINO); it's now a structurally distinct letter+8-digit pattern with its own checksum validator (IDCARD_DE). Added EU AI Act and NIS2 compliance-flag mappings alongside existing GDPR/PCI-DSS/NIST tags. Added PrivacySessionManager for isolating placeholder sessions across many concurrent conversations (multi-chatbot/AI-gateway use cases). Added AiTransparencyNotice (configurable, localized EN/IT/DE/FR/ES) for AI Act Art.50-style \"you're talking to an AI\" disclosures, and ChatIntentRouter for routing bot commands before they reach the analyzer. Added a /dashboard command to the Demo for aggregate batch stats. Fixed all nullable-reference build warnings (net8.0 and netstandard2.0 now build with zero warnings). 25 new regression tests (230/230 total).",
